{"sample_key": "frozen_airchina:r0:t2", "source_key": "airchina", "prior_replies": ["我根据这份国航提示，把发布日期、适用范围和携带条件整理如下：该提示发布日期为2026年8月4日；适用范围为乘坐国航航班的旅客，其中关于3C标识的规定特别适用于中国境内航班。\n\n- 禁运范围：生产厂家召回（召回信息在“国家市场监督管理总局缺陷产品召回技术中心”官网“消费品召回”栏目查询）、鼓包、变形、开裂、标识不清，以及无法确认额定能量或锂金属含量的充电宝一律禁运。\n\n- 数量与能量规格：每人最多携带2块，单个额定能量不得超过160Wh；100Wh及以下无需国航批准，超过100Wh但不超过160Wh则必须经国航批准。\n\n- 携带及机上要求：只能随身携带且绝不允许托运；乘坐中国境内航班须有清晰3C标识；具备开关功能的需关闭电源；全程禁止放入行李架，禁止使用充电宝给任何设备供电，也禁止使用机上电源给充电宝充电；须做好绝缘防护并放置于前方座椅下方的手提行李或座椅靠背口袋内。"], "generation_id": "307b931e-a00d-41ed-bd8d-6dca33acdf5c", "identity": {"schema_version": "1.0", "identity_hash": "fdb1e45913b7f55ec32480549e57d2d4b1c8d936290c302a1b6dc4fb119401ae", "character_id": "default", "character_package_hash": "9fca992decf57d4e2060aabedd8cc019613c4df67f37ade2f61daf6e4bbf910f", "prompt_template_version": "v13", "presentation_profile": "detailed_answer", "chat_route": {"role": "chat", "provider": "openai_compatible", "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-high", "endpoint_digest": "937c7a5a291b7e56db4b0f98cc3054b5443743de0cb8d3ca60189a15e1686b14", "context_window": 32768, "budget": {"version": "1.0", "input_token_limit": null, "output_token_limit": null, "output_reserve_tokens": 8192, "max_output_tokens": 8192, "estimate_margin_ratio": 0.15, "section_policy": "scaled", "history_turn_limit": 16, "memory_candidate_limit": 12, "tool_result_max_bytes": 131072}}, "memory_summary_route": {"role": "memory_summary", "provider": "demo", "model": "deterministic-summary-v1", "endpoint_digest": null, "context_window": 8192, "budget": {"version": "1.0", "input_token_limit": null, "output_token_limit": null, "output_reserve_tokens": 900, "max_output_tokens": null, "estimate_margin_ratio": 0.0, "section_policy": "legacy", "history_turn_limit": 16, "memory_candidate_limit": 12, "tool_result_max_bytes": 32768}}, "tools_digest": "ce43edd5bd9fc8ad118e0a0224b3c7b5"}, "report": {"model_role": "chat", "budget": 21370, "used": 3239, "safety_tokens": 1590, "persona_tokens": 786, "state_tokens": 7, "relation